## About Our Client ##
Our client is a well-established commercial bank in Switzerland and other international financial places.
## Job Description ##
* Joining the Corporate Banking Desk of the Bank;
* Reviewing and structuring Corporate Banking and Trade Finance transactions in line with approved credit facilities and risk parameters;
* Coordinating the execution of financed and non-financed transactions with internal stakeholders to ensure smooth processing;
* Monitoring credit line utilizations, collateral coverage and transactional risks as part of the first line of defense;
* Managing and following up on payments, trade finance instruments, FX transactions and other banking operations;
* Maintaining regular contact with clients and Relationship Managers to support transaction execution and optimize facility utilization;
* Monitoring transaction pipelines, repayments and facility maturities, ensuring timely follow-up and reporting;
* Supporting the preparation of credit renewals, amendments and related documentation;
* Identifying, escalating and helping to resolve credit, operational and compliance-related issues when required;
* Reporting to the clients and the Management;
* Participation of the day-to-day in the office.
## The Successful Applicant ##
* Graduated from an University degree in Finance, Economics, Banking or equivalent;
* 3-5 years of professional experience in Corporate Banking, Trade Finance or Transaction Management ideally;
* Good knowledge of trade finance products, banking operations and credit facilities;
* Strong risk awareness and understanding of transactional controls;
* Proficient in MS Office applications, particularly Excel;
* Fluency in Turkish and English is essential; French would be a strong asset;
* Excellent organizational skills with the ability to manage multiple priorities and deadlines;
* Strong attention to detail and ability to monitor transactions throughout their lifecycle;
* Good communication skills and ability to collaborate with various internal stakeholders;
* Proactive, reliable and solution-oriented team player;
* Discretion and sense of confidentiality;
* Swiss residence ideally.
## What's on Offer ##
Our client offers a 100% permanent contract within a qualitative, human-sized and international working environment. Remote work could also be possible sometimes in the week.
